==History==
2016
*The Goblin Barrel [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 11/1/2016, the [[Version History#The First Update (11/1/2016)|First Update]], decreased the Goblin Barrel's spawned [[Goblins]] Level by 1. Before this update, a Level 8 Goblin Barrel would be able to spawn Level 14 Goblins.
*On 19/2/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/2/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblin Barrel's [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Tower]] damage to 40% of the full damage (from 50%).
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March%202016%20Update%20(29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], decreased the Goblins' sight range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May%202016%20Update%20(3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], fixed the “range bug”, which decreased the Goblins' range to 0.5 tiles (from 1 tile), but their effective range was unchanged. It also made a small change to the Goblin Barrel's card description. Also, before the update, the Goblin Barrel was able to spawn Level 13 Goblins while the Level cap for the Skeletons card was 12. The [[Witch]] was able to do the same with the [[Skeletons]].
*On 21/6/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (21/6/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblins' spawn time to 1 second (from 1.2 seconds).
*On 4/7/2016, the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]], decreased the Goblin Barrel's cost to 3 [[Elixir]] (from 4 Elixir), increased its Goblin spawn time to 1.2 seconds (from 1 second), and removed its impact damage.
2017
*On 11/10/2017, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(11/10/2017)|maintenance break]], temporarily removed the Goblin Barrel from the [[Touchdown]] [[:Category:Modes|mode]] due to a bug where scoring a touchdown did not clear flying barrels from the [[Arenas|Arena]], which break into Goblins to score another touchdown while the opponent is unable to defend against it.
*On 12/12/2017, the [[Version History#Electrifying Update (12/12/2017)|Electrifying Update]], decreased the Goblins’ damage by 6%.
2018
*On 2/7/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/7/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblins' hitpoints by 1%. This was to fix an inconsistency with [[Minions]] that could not take out Goblins in two hits at the same Level.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Epic}} cards start at Level 6 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 8).
2019
*On 6/5/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/5/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblins' spawn time to 1.1 seconds (from 1.2 seconds).
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Goblin Barrel from Goblin Stadium to Barbarian Bowl. It also added a card render to the Goblin Barrel's card info screen.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], increased the Goblins' first attack time interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.2 seconds). It also moved the Arena to unlock the Goblin Barrel from Barbarian Bowl to P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024

* On 3/6/2023, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (3/6/2024)|June 2024 Update]], added the Goblin Barrel's Evolution.
* On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], added the Goblin Barrel to the Goblin class.

