==Trivia==
*Goblins are small, grotesque, monstrous creatures that appear in the folklore of multiple European cultures. First attested in stories from the Middle Ages, they are ascribed conflicting abilities, temperaments, and appearances depending on the story and country of origin, ranging from mischievous household spirits to malicious, bestial thieves. They often have magical abilities similar to a fairy or demon, such as the ability to shapeshift. Similar creatures include [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Duende duendes], [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kobold kobolds], [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leprechaun leprechauns], and [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghoul ghouls].
**In the German and Dutch language setting of the game, the Goblin Barrel's name translates to "Kobold Barrel". In the Spanish, Arabic, Thai, and Vietnamese language setting of the game, the Goblin Barrel's name translates to "Duende Barrel", "Ghoul Barrel", "Goblin Tank" and "Leprechaun Box" respectively.
**The Goblin Barrel is 1 of 17 [[cards]] associated with [[Goblins]], with the others being [[Spear Goblins]], [[Goblin Gang]], [[Baby Goblins]], [[Dart Goblin]], [[Goblin Demolisher]], [[Suspicious Bush]], [[Goblin Cage]], [[Goblin Hut]], [[Goblin Giant]], [[Goblin Curse]], [[Goblin Drill]], [[Goblin Machine]], [[Party Rocket]], [[Party Hut]], [[Goblinstein]], and of course, Goblins.
*While not available as a spell in Clash of Clans, the Goblin Barrel may have inspired the [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Goblin_Thrower Goblin Thrower] building, which launches Goblin Barrels of Spear Goblins instead, another card which inspired something in that game.
*The Goblin Barrel is 1 of 3 cards related to barrels, alongside the [[Skeleton Barrel]] and [[Barbarian Barrel]].
*The Goblin Barrel has the smallest radius out of all [[:Category:Spell Cards|spells]] in the game, with a radius of 1.5 tiles.
*The Goblin Barrel is one of the first cards to ever receive balance changes since [[Version History#The First Update (11/1/2016)|The First Update]], the others being the [[Mortar]], [[Witch]], and [[Prince]].
**It is the first spell card to ever receive balance changes.
*The Goblin Barrel is 1 of 23 cards that has had its [[Elixir]] cost changed, the others being [[Bomber]], [[Fire Spirit]], [[Royal Recruits]], [[Cannon]], Mortar, [[Musketeer]], [[Three Musketeers]], [[Heal]], Goblin Hut, [[Bomb Tower]], [[Barbarian Hut]], [[Furnace]], [[Elixir Collector]], [[Skeleton Army]], [[P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Wall Breakers]], [[Electro Giant]], [[Bowler]], [[Barbarian Barrel]], [[Rage]], [[Fisherman]], and the [[Monk]].
*The barrel of the Goblin Barrel looks similar to the hull of the [[Rocket]].
*The [[Goblin Machine]]'s torso was created using an empty Goblin Barrel.
*Its [[Star Points|Star Level 3 Skin]] grants the Goblins a red mohawk similar to the Level 6 Goblin in Clash of Clans.
*Another Goblin's leg can be seen sticking out of the Barrel on the card image.
*In the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mtgrUd-Pvmc Goblin Barrel commercial], 4 Goblins are shown coming out of the Goblin Barrel, despite the Goblin Barrel only spawning 3 Goblins.
*The Goblin Barrel is unavailable in multiple [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|special gamemodes]]. More specifically:
**It is 1 of 2 cards that is unavailable in [[Touchdown]] Draft, the other being Elixir Collector.
**It is 1 of 3 cards that is unavailable in Boost Fields, the others being Goblin Drill and [[Miner]].
*The Goblin Barrel is the subject of an [[Emotes|Emote]].
*The description incorrectly mentions that the Goblin Barrel can be placed anywhere in the [[Arenas|Arena]], as it is unable to be placed directly on the river.
**The Goblin Barrel is the only spell that cannot be placed directly on the river.
*On 1/4/2016, certain Content Creators were given a different version of the game, with a Mortar that attacked by shooting Goblin Barrels instead of boulders.
*The Goblin Barrel was featured in the winning [[Battle Decks|deck]] of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/psZXKWHkKkE?si=PbjvbZt8stghz6eJ King's Cup II Tournament], by a player called Surgical Goblin.
*On 3/1/2024, the Goblin Barrel was supposed to receive a Goblin first attack time interval increase to 0.5 seconds (from 0.4 seconds), but this change [https://royaleapi.com/blog/season-55-balance-wip was pulled back last minute].
*Before the Goblin Barrel's card release, the Goblin Barrel's Goblin spawn time was decreased to 1.2 seconds (from 1.3 second), and it was added impact damage.

